


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_09803690:


    "伦瞅准了她的破绽，两手钻进了阳菜的毛衣。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_55d1a3e5:



    voice "d/2HI_0273"
    hina "「喂、喂！你做什么——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_35d50629:


    "不等阳菜抗议，伦的手便在阳菜的胸罩上找到了她敏感的突起。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_4337097c:



    voice "d/2HI_0274"
    hina "「呀啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_2ea30e68:


    "事到如今，阳菜已无法反抗，整个人疲软无力地倒了下去。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_30810b4c:



    voice "d/2RI_0260"
    rin "「还是很敏感呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_7a04e360:



    voice "d/2HI_0275"
    hina "「啊嗯……嗯嗯！你、你使诈……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_05ca6723:



    voice "d/2RI_0261"
    rin "「很可爱哦，阳菜……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_955e4d1d:


    "致命一击的美声。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_8f86afa5:



    voice "d/2HI_0276"
    hina "「嗯嗯嗯嗯！超级使诈——！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_88d8e1d3:



    voice "d/2RI_0262"
    rin "「要戴上了哦。抬起下巴？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_9ca9872a:



    voice "d/2HI_0277"
    hina "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_eb4e0f3d:


    "一旦戴上这个（项圈），阳菜就会成为伦的所有物。这是阳菜给自己定下的规矩。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_e5909f88:


    "但是，这孩子一定没有往SM这种情趣方面想。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_7d4d085b:


    "她只是在顺从自己“喜欢伦”的心情。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_a4908f48:


    "……伦又如何呢？"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou2_03_d_bb6d7f9e:


    "好戏即将上演。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_048c0dab:


    "阳菜抓住了梯子的侧边。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_126faf83:


    "她已经被褪去了身下的所有衣物，屁股裸露在空气之中；上身的胸罩也被剥去，轻微的隆起裸露在外。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_e1ae679e:



    voice "d/2HI_0278"
    hina "「咿嗯嗯……！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_140f1a2b:


    "只是乳首被轻轻捏起，阳菜的身子便大幅拱起。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_ef0fdefd:



    voice "d/2RI_0263"
    rin "「这里是弱点呢。啊，不过你全身上下都是弱点来着」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_d783144b:



    voice "d/2HI_0279"
    hina "「那是因为伦的手法——」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_035f6c98:



    voice "d/2RI_0264B"
    rin "「什么手法？我还什么都没做呢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_56db90cc:


    "伦说着，用指尖弹了弹阳菜的乳尖。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_ac42f477:



    voice "d/2HI_0280"
    hina "「呀啊啊啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_a88e5a7c:


    "阳菜的喊声比刚才还要响亮。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_333faa04:



    voice "d/2RI_0265"
    rin "「是因为阳菜的身体太下流～才会有感觉哦～」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_64ea94aa:



    voice "d/2HI_0281"
    hina "「哈唔……哈呜……哈唔哈唔」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_5a168c20:


    "伦的手一直在阳菜的乳首打转，不给阳菜反驳的机会。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_e75c3d72:



    voice "d/2RI_0266"
    rin "「竟然推卸责任，你可是一条坏狗狗哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_c91f5043:



    voice "d/2HI_0282"
    hina "「不、不是推卸责任……我只是……想说伦技术很好」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_c33485dc:



    voice "d/2RI_0267"
    rin "「这、这样啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_005cdd81:


    "被人夸奖也不是坏事嘛。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_e6b6462e:



    voice "d/2RI_0268"
    rin "「你夸我我很高兴啦，但阳菜不喜欢做舒服的事情吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_23d44b02:



    voice "d/2HI_0283"
    hina "「不是不喜欢……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_533f5627:



    voice "d/2RI_0269"
    rin "「那你就老老实实舒服起来嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_b8da992a:



    voice "d/2HI_0284"
    hina "「……你不会讨厌下流的孩子吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_f93d6c25:



    voice "d/2RI_0270"
    rin "「噢、哦哦……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_aac41e3e:


    "伦摇摇欲坠。漂亮的反击，效果显著。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_0515c3bf:



    voice "d/2RI_0271"
    rin "「你、你……你这个可爱的小东西」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_63a8dd23:



    voice "d/2RI_0272"
    rin "「怎、怎么可能会讨厌啦！好了，你就尽管变得下流吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_ea449bcd:



    voice "d/2HI_0285"
    hina "「啊、呀咿！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_da281407:


    "伦再次爱抚起阳菜的酥胸。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_a8f92bf3:


    "阳菜的胸不够大，揉不起来，因此伦或是捏起、或是用手指按压与摩擦，集中刺激着阳菜的突起。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_0ab87811:


    "不过这次她是来真的。和先前捉弄阳菜时的手法不同，此刻的伦正动用着自己所有的知识、技术与爱情来取悦阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_2f496ab5:


    "阳菜只是被碰一下都会发出娇喘。在这般激烈的爱抚下，喊声更是连绵不绝。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_81a10c67:



    voice "d/2HI_0286"
    hina "「啊啊啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_17fa4105:



    voice sustain
    "就像这样。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_1009c40b:



    voice "d/2RI_0273"
    rin "「看，阳菜的这里，越来越硬了哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_0c032065:



    voice "d/2HI_0287"
    hina "「我、我自己……不知道啦……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_c9445d6e:



    voice "d/2RI_0274"
    rin "「……是吗？不痛吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_4e49a367:



    voice "d/2HI_0288"
    hina "「不……不痛」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_d1af8855:



    voice "d/2RI_0275"
    rin "「那我加重捏的力度也可以吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_2e8b6331:



    voice "d/2HI_0289"
    hina "「诶……怎么……更、用力的话……啊呜呜呜！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_9e7a91d9:


    "阳菜的反应明显比刚才更加激烈。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_7fa636d3:


    "伦很是满意。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_adc7b75a:



    voice "d/2HI_0290"
    hina "「啊……啊……啊啊……嗯嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_6922cf17:



    voice sustain
    "伦一下一下地捏着，阳菜也随之娇喘阵阵。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_241d75d9:


    "伦的爱抚从多样渐渐集中为阳菜反应最佳的一种。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_22439d49:


    "体内的冲击顺着畅通无阻的水路，将阳菜逼到决堤瞬间。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_cb64e404:


    "然后。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_eceecce2:



    voice "d/2HI_0291"
    hina "「……哈啊啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_1589e9b9:



    voice sustain
    "阳菜猛烈地晃动起身子，被她抓紧的梯子嘎吱作响。大概是轻微高潮了吧。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_d7a268c8:


    "看着阳菜通红的脸颊，伦意犹未尽、乐在其中。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_c0ef9440:



    voice "d/2RI_0276"
    rin "「还没完哦，这次就用这边让你舒服起来」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_99de43cd:


    "伦爱抚着阳菜乳房（？）的手向下滑落。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_6e57539f:



    voice "d/2HI_0292"
    hina "「哈唔……？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_86a32794:


    "如梦初醒的阳菜，因下腹上手指潜行的感触而回过神来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_caae1e50:



    voice "d/2RI_0277"
    rin "「这边更舒服对吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_4ea13a88:



    voice "d/2HI_0293"
    hina "「哈、哈呜……那个」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_5517b0c1:



    voice "d/2RI_0278"
    rin "「不用回答。我都知道的……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_850e247b:


    "阳菜还未给出答复，伦已经往目的地伸出手指。然后，她指尖所到之处传出水声，宣布成功抵达。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_50590d57:



    voice "d/2RI_0279"
    rin "「都湿透了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_47c46ad4:



    voice "d/2HI_0294"
    hina "「……呜呜」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_48459c7c:


    "和最开始的时候不同。而这不同意味着什么，就连阳菜也心中有数。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_460ec22e:



    voice "d/2HI_0295"
    hina "「……对不起」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_cd9730b6:



    voice "d/2RI_0280"
    rin "「为什么要道歉？我很开心啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_c16a6f28:



    voice "d/2HI_0296"
    hina "「开心……吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_c6b895a5:



    voice "d/2RI_0281"
    rin "「因为这说明你很舒服吧？作为让你舒服起来的本人，我怎么可能不开心呢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_d51e303d:



    voice "d/2HI_0297"
    hina "「呃、嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_d60bac96:



    voice "d/2RI_0282"
    rin "「嘛，也和阳菜下流的身体脱不了关系就对了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_e87e880e:



    voice "d/2HI_0298"
    hina "「……咕」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_58d9a5ec:



    voice "d/2RI_0283"
    rin "「你想变得更舒服吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_54c89fdf:



    voice "d/2HI_0299"
    hina "「……笨蛋」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_3ac642ec:



    voice "d/2RI_0284"
    rin "「啊，你竟然说我笨～」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_a601e5f3:



    voice "d/2HI_0300"
    hina "「呀唔！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_6a37ed1e:


    "伦的手指被柔软的裂缝吸入其中。阳菜如同受惊的小动物般叫唤起来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_d916a310:



    voice "d/2RI_0285"
    rin "「好烫。体温好高。果然——」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_ede09049:



    voice "d/2HI_0301"
    hina "「你、你……你别说了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_ba6615b4:



    voice "d/2RI_0286"
    rin "「嘿嘿，好的好的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_34b05d36:


    "伦的手指贴着阳菜的内壁左右摆动。动作虽然轻柔，但阳菜的全身都在随着性感带而颤抖。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_f6724342:



    voice "d/2RI_0287"
    rin "「你听到这里咕啾咕啾的声音了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_ab230ff1:



    voice "d/2HI_0302"
    hina "「所以说……不要再说了啦」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_42655a18:



    voice "d/2RI_0288"
    rin "「诶～谁让我是笨蛋嘛，一股脑地就全说出口了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_10935198:



    voice "d/2HI_0303"
    hina "「呜呜呜呜……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_3e2fbe73:


    "伦这种时候总是格外的能言善辩。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_54145b5f:



    voice "d/2RI_0289"
    rin "「手指都黏黏糊糊的了，不过这样更润滑也挺好……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_b9061b66:



    voice "d/2HI_0304"
    hina "「啊……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_3e11584d:


    "伦动一动手，阳菜老实开口。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_20647042:



    voice "d/2RI_0290"
    rin "「嗯……刺激加强一点吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_3926a7b6:


    "伦说着，手指陷入了裂缝的更深处。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_6d42a999:


    "她的中指关节稍稍摩擦着阳菜敏感的突起。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_0145c7b2:



    voice "d/2HI_0305"
    hina "「呀……那里、太舒服了！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_588e387d:



    voice "d/2RI_0291"
    rin "「嗯？太舒服不行吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_d2549165:



    voice "d/2HI_0306"
    hina "「会、会一片空白……意、意识会飞走」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_a2ec22a9:



    voice "d/2RI_0292B"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_02a33e18:


    "伦舔了舔上唇，喜不自胜。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_f12193bc:



    voice "d/2RI_0293"
    rin "「那·我·就·让·你·飞·起·来」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_ef1c34c3:



    voice "d/2HI_0307"
    hina "「咿……嗯啊啊啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_031236a4:


    "沾满蜜汁的指腹，掠过了阳菜的核心。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_a3734347:



    voice "d/2RI_0294"
    rin "「我的手指能感觉到你这里硬起来了哦」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_c5fbe508:


    "阳菜的“那里”算是比较隐蔽的，但她如此敏感，透过遮蔽的略微凸起可能恰到好处。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_4bc21a47:



    voice "d/2HI_0308"
    hina "「啊啊啊！！啊啊嗯嗯！！呀啊啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_be58df27:


    "潺潺的水声、床的晃动声、阳菜的娇喘声在房间里此起彼伏。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_467ac12d:



    voice "d/2RI_0295"
    rin "「声音有～点大哦，小阳菜？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_7592e78b:



    voice "d/2HI_0309"
    hina "「嗯咕……？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_429e04e4:



    voice "d/2RI_0296"
    rin "「这个，要吸住哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_24aa16c0:


    "伦把手指轻轻伸入阳菜娇喘不断的嘴中。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_cd8d9fe8:



    voice "d/2HI_0310"
    hina "「唔、唔唔……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_f7c31b99:


    "阳菜只是惊讶了片刻便立马接受了现状。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_721479bf:



    voice "d/2RI_0297"
    rin "「嘴里也是性感带哦～？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_8df7d99f:


    "瞧她一脸得意样。十有八九是从什么书里读来的。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_404556a4:



    voice "d/2HI_0311"
    hina "「嗯唔……嗯嗯～啾」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_fd6054e5:


    "每当伦轻触阳菜的嘴内，阳菜的舌头便会好客地缠上来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_939b9315:



    voice "d/2RI_0298"
    rin "「呜哇、舌头，好舒服。我也有些来电了……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_f7bb6cef:


    "伦的背阵阵发抖。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_60b706e2:



    voice "d/2HI_0312"
    hina "「啾……啾唔……嗯嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_bd54e5a1:


    "阳菜不知是否听到了伦的自言自语，更加热情地吮吸着伦的手指。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_8da6cedd:



    voice "d/2RI_0299"
    rin "「嗯……小狗狗很擅长舔东西啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_587ef1f5:



    voice "d/2HI_0313"
    hina "「……嗯嗯……嗯……啾唔」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_6d140d8c:



    voice "d/2RI_0300"
    rin "「呼呼，狗狗这么聪明，可得奖励一下……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_b3882a5f:



    voice "d/2HI_0314"
    hina "「咿唔……奖……励？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_c144ab0f:



    voice "d/2RI_0301"
    rin "「嗯。飞吧，阳菜？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_4dfdaee5:



    voice "d/2HI_0315"
    hina "「嗯唔！！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_4ec17953:


    "对阳菜核心的爱抚突然激烈起来。与此同时，阳菜嘴里的手指也更加深入。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_16832049:



    voice "d/2HI_0316"
    hina "「哈咕……嗯咕唔唔！！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_4f3a54ae:


    "舌头已经无法像刚才那样舔舐，只能任由手指蹂躏。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_94129b25:



    voice "d/2RI_0302"
    rin "「会难受吗？是不是深了点？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene03_9d74ef2e:


